    "steam_appid": 581460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581460/extras/a2c4de2d63209d57ec628d658f4abde3.avif?t=1726420812\" /></div><br>QuiVr Vanguard gives you a bite sized fantasy archery experience built from the ground up for VR. A map loved by many of the VR Early Adopters, bow mechanics fine tuned over years of development, and an ever expanding pool of items and enemies make QuiVr Vanguard a fantastic intro to VR or a fun way to kill some time.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581460/extras/554c6112169b505a7e9fc57d34edf650.avif?t=1726420812\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Best in class bow and arrow physics, battle tested in QuiVr<br></li><li>Drop-in/Drop-out multiplayer<br></li><li>Global, weekly leaderboards<br></li><li>Multiple environment skins<br></li><li>Varied subset of enemies found in QuiVr<br></li><li>Random item rewards as you play</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581460/extras/a2c4de2d63209d57ec628d658f4abde3.avif?t=1726420812\" /></div><br>QuiVr Vanguard gives you a bite sized fantasy archery experience built from the ground up for VR. A map loved by many of the VR Early Adopters, bow mechanics fine tuned over years of development, and an ever expanding pool of items and enemies make QuiVr Vanguard a fantastic intro to VR or a fun way to kill some time.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/581460/extras/554c6112169b505a7e9fc57d34edf650.avif?t=1726420812\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Best in class bow and arrow physics, battle tested in QuiVr<br></li><li>Drop-in/Drop-out multiplayer<br></li><li>Global, weekly leaderboards<br></li><li>Multiple environment skins<br></li><li>Varied subset of enemies found in QuiVr<br></li><li>Random item rewards as you play</li></ul>",
